{"id":1010101,"name":"迪蒙·审查Ⅰ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"迪蒙·审查Ⅰ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1010101]}],"trial":{"trial_id":10101,"stage":"阶段1","unlock_time":"2022-11-10 18:00:00","diary1":"管理局定位到禁闭者迪蒙的位置信息后，出动了上千名公职人员。即便如此，整个抓捕行动依旧持续了超过60个小时。\n　　迪蒙被控制后，市议会第一时间联系了你，并主动提供了几样物证。八年前，市议会就已经下达了对迪蒙的重刑决议。可直到八年后，这位赫赫有名的队长才在MBCC的追捕下落网。\n　　现在，多个势力都盯上了迪蒙。30天后，将有一场针对他的审判。但在他们找上你之前，你需要与正主进行一次“友好沟通”。","diary2":"从迪蒙今天的表现来看，疑点没有减少，反而变得更多了。虽然大多凶案证据确凿，但动机却完全不明。\n　　尤其是他最后面对那个手链的反应，太过反常，并不像市议会告诉你的那样，是一个纯粹、冷静的伤人者。\n　　你需要更多的调查。","evidence":[{"ID":260074,"Num":1},{"ID":260076,"Num":1},{"ID":260078,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260075,"Num":1},{"ID":260077,"Num":1},{"ID":260079,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":1,"dialogue_id":110101002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":3,"dialogue_id":110101012,"next":[13,17]},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101016,"next":[21]},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110101020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_i